              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\"><font face=\"Arial\"></font><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font face=\"Arial\">Dear {!$Expression.First_Name} {!$Expression.Last_Name},<br /><br />Thank you for applying to Zeta High School! <br /><br />We are so excited that you are considering Zeta High, and we look forward to being with you through the next steps of the enrollment process.<br /><br /><strong>Log in <font color=\"#4f497a\" style=\"\"><a href=\"https://myportal.zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" style=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>here</u></a></font> to view your application.</strong><br /><br />At Zeta High, students discover their purpose, pursue their passions, and build the power to shape their future. Through rigorous academics, personalized guidance, and real-world experiences, students prepare for college and a life of their own choosing.<br /></font></span></span>"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
